eq/tarball/2.0.1", "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/logseq/logseq/zipball/2.0.1", "body": "# Logseq 2.0 Beta (DB version) is here! \ud83c\udf89\r\n\r\nAfter a long wait, our first Logseq 2.0 beta release is finally here. We know many of you have been looking forward to trying it, and we\u2019re excited to put it in your hands!\r\n\r\nThis is an early beta, so you may encounter some rough edges. We\u2019d love for you to give it a try and tell us what works, what doesn\u2019t, and what you\u2019d like to see next. Your feedback will help us improve Logseq and shape the stable release.\r\n\r\nBefore getting started, please take a moment to read these updates:\r\n\r\n- [Live roadmap](https://logseq.io/p/NX4mc_ggEV)\r\n- [Big update: Logseq is splitting into two versions](https://logseq.io/p/e3YDyX5AYr)\r\n\r\nAs with any beta, please back up your important data before testing. You can share feedback and report issues through our [GitHub issue tracker](https://github.com/logseq/db-test/issues).\r\n\r\nThank you for your patience, encouragement, and continued support. We\u2019re excited to begin this next chapter with you! \u2764\ufe0f", "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/logseq/logseq/releases/341240475/reactions", "total_count": 102, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 47, "confused": 0, "heart": 41, "rocket": 10, "eyes": 4}}